-# msbwt Wiki — staging directory
-
-This directory contains the prepared GitHub Wiki page set for
-[`github.com/Taksir/msbwt`](https://github.com/Taksir/msbwt).
-
-**The wiki repository does not exist yet.**  It will appear once the
-wiki is initialized on GitHub (see below).  Until then, keep these pages
-here; when the wiki exists, copy/commit them into
-`https://github.com/Taksir/msbwt.wiki.git`.
-
-## How to publish (manual step, once)
-
-1. On GitHub, open `https://github.com/Taksir/msbwt` → **Wiki** tab →
-   **Create the first page** (GitHub creates the wiki repository at
-   `https://github.com/Taksir/msbwt.wiki.git`).
-2. Clone the wiki next to this staging directory:
-
-   ```bash
-   git clone https://github.com/Taksir/msbwt.wiki.git ../msbwt-wiki
-   ```
-
-3. Copy the pages (including `_Sidebar.md` and `Home.md`) into the wiki
-   clone:
-
-   ```bash
-   cp *.md ../msbwt-wiki/
-   ```
-
-4. Commit and push:
-
-   ```bash
-   cd ../msbwt-wiki
-   git add Home.md _Sidebar.md *.md
-   git commit -m "docs: populate msbwt wiki"
-   git push
-   ```
-
